# DrumMania 2nd Mix (GE912 VER. JAB): a game, from what drmn2m-install.his left (the flash
# installed; the game cassette in). The boot loads its data for a while (NOW LOADING (2) 19/19); the
# title is at frame ~15,600 (two coins a credit). Two coins, Start through the screens to the music
# select's default; the stage played on the pads: the snare every 8 frames, the hi-hat every 16, the
# bass drum every 12, a tom or the cymbal now and then. Hashes the main RAM every frame, snapshots
# every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game drmn2m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 16300 press "Coin 1" 8
at 16340 press "Coin 1" 8
at 16500 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 16800 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 17100 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 17400 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 17700 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 18000 every 8 press "Snare" 4
from 18004 every 16 press "Hi-Hat" 4
from 18002 every 12 press "Bass Drum" 4
from 18010 every 48 press "High Tom" 4
from 18034 every 48 press "Low Tom" 4
from 18050 every 96 press "Cymbal" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 25400 quit
